---
title: "repay_on_behalf (Pebble Protocol: Lending Entry Points)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate_market(market)
    q_validate --> q_version: ensure_version_matches()
    q_version --> q_circuit_break: check circuit_break
    q_circuit_break --> q_error_cb: circuit_break triggered
    q_error_cb --> [*]: abort market_under_circuit_break
    q_circuit_break --> q_timestamp: now = clock.timestamp_ms() / 1000
    q_timestamp --> q_get_amount: repay_amount = coin.value()
    q_get_amount --> q_handle_repay: handle_repay(obligation_id, coin, now, ctx)
    q_handle_repay --> q_update_reward: update_obligation_reward_manager(borrow_reward_type, total_borrow.floor())
    q_update_reward --> q_emit: emit RepayEvent
    q_emit --> [*]: return refund coin

    note right of q_handle_repay
        INV-001: coin.value() must be non-zero
        INV-002: obligation must belong to this market
        INV-003: interest accrued before repay calculation
        INV-004: residual (overpayment) returned as refund
        INV-005: debt removed from obligation if fully repaid
        INV-006: debt must be >= min_borrow_amount or zero after operation
        INV-007: borrow rate limiter outflow reduced by repay amount
        INV-008: emode group borrow amount updated
    end note
